  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2102.13 Licensed ADS contractor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.13 “Licensed ADS contractor” means a contractor who holds a valid ADS contractor license pursuant to RSA 141-E:10 and Env-A 1811.\n\nSource. #7647, eff 2-16-02 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 2100) (formerly Env-Wm 3902.13); ss by #9645, eff 2-16-10 (from Env-Sw 2102.14); ss by #12605, eff 9-1-18 (formerly Env-Sw 2102.07)",
